{{ToonInfo|type=Event|Toon=Eclipse|extra=Werewolf|Date=October 10, 2025|with={{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}, {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}}, and {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}}|Pronoun=She|event=Halloween|store=Gourdy's}}

==Appearance==
Eclipse is a blue-gray {{wp|werewolf}} with a sea pink crescent moon on her forehead that seems to glow in the dark. Her snout, the front of her torso, the end of her tail, and her inner ears are a lighter shade of gray, while the tips of her ears and paws are a dark blue. She wears a short black shawl with a sea pink trim around her shoulders, along with her grin revealing one of many of her sharp teeth. In the presence of a [[Blackout]], her pupils become slits, she becomes a little bit bulkier, her ears become fluffier, and her smile reveals sharp teeth.

==Personality==
Eclipse is very overly excited and scatterbrained, as seen in her interactions with other [[Toons]] such as {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}} and {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}}. She tries to get everyone more hyped and psyched up for the deeper [[Floors]], yet ends up making some other Toons weirded out. She thinks of the other Toons as pack members, wanting to be friends with others on the basis of potentially doing wolf related activities, like howling at the moon together.

When she's in a [[Blackout]] though, she seems to be more aggressive and unhinged, as shown with her expression and according to Gourdy's [[Gossip]] about her. This is probably due to her werewolf form taking over in Blackouts, making her hunting instincts and physical capabilities stronger, as well as harder to control.

Eclipse is also shown to have a fascination with lights, the moon, and stars, often bringing them up in conversations. This is most prevalent with {{CI|Brightney|name=true}}, where she expresses enthusiastic interest in the former's bright lightbulb, or when she acts overly gregarious towards {{CI|Astro|name=true}}, a crescent moon; both of which lead to awkward responses.

