==Requirement Strategies==
*For the first requirement, focus on picking up {{II|Pumpkins|name=true}} and extracting [[Machines]]. The Machine and Pumpkin count increases the further you descend, so you can earn more Pumpkins.
*For the second requirement, try to farm a good amount of Ichor, and buy Toons that cost less Ichor; you get {{CI|Boxten|name=true}} or {{CI|Poppy|name=true}} for free, so you only need to get 4 more Toons. Some Toons who are easy to get and have lower Ichor requirements can include {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}, {{CI|Finn|name=true}}, {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}, {{CI|Toodles|name=true}}, and {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}}.
