==Trivia==
*Eclipse, {{CI|Rudie|name=true}}, and {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}} are all anthropomorphic [[Toons]] with non-plantigrade legs (Eclipse and Cocoa are digitigrade, while Rudie is unguligrade). Eclipse is the third Toon with this trait.
*Eclipse is the third [[Toon]] to have sharp teeth, after {{CI|Goob|name=true}} and {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}.
*Eclipse is the first and currently only Rare [[Toon]] to have a Passive [[Ability]] instead of the usual Active ability.
*Despite her [[Ability]] description saying she receives an extra 2 {{Star}} into Stamina in [[Blackouts]] (which would total to 200 Stamina), her Stamina instead increases by 60%, essentially giving her about four extra stars instead by default.
**It is unknown whether this is a bug or an Ability description mistake.
**If her Ability did add 2 Stars during Blackouts, her Stamina would need to be increased by 1/3, or around 33% as a [[Multiplier]].
*Eclipse is capable of getting the highest maximum Stamina amount in the entire game.
**If an Eclipse were to pick both {{CDI|Well-Paced/Endurance|name=true}}, complete [[Dyle's Floor]] and end up in a [[Blackout]] afterwards, she will gain (150+20+50)*1.6 maximum Stamina, or a Stamina capacity of 352. That is the equivalent of having 11 Stars Stamina with 2 extra units.
***Combining this with both {{TI|Cooler|name=true}} and maxed {{TI|Friendship Bracelet|name=true}} will give her (150+20+50+50+40)*1.6 or 496 Stamina capacity, nearly 17 Star Stamina (16.84 Stars to be exact).
*Eclipse uses the same walk and run animation as her normal self when she is extracting a [[Treadmill Machine]] while in her transformed form.
**She also uses the same extracting animation in this form, which makes her head clip inside of the Machine and hands float over the valve.
*There was a bug where if Eclipse got hit by a [[Twisted]] on a non-[[Blackout]], her face texture couldn't change from default to transformed and vice versa if hurt on a Blackout with no prior damage.
*After {{CI|Connie|name=true}} left the [[Halloween]] cast, Eclipse served as her replacement.
*There used to be a bug where if Eclipse used {{TI|Vee's Remote|name=true}} while transforming in a [[Blackout]], she wouldn't be able to do that [[Machine]].
*Eclipse likes to howl at the moon as said in her dialogue with {{CI|Astro|name=true}} and {{CI|Looey|name=true}}, making sense with her werewolf nature.
*Eclipse, {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}, and {{CI|Coal|name=true}} are canine [[Toons]] with staring problems. When talking to [[Ribecca]], she either genuinely was just zoned out, or was enticed by the fact her entire body is made of bones.
*Eclipse is the first [[Toon]] whose face changes when her [[Ability]] is active.
**{{CI|Cosmo|name=true}} could count, but his face changes to his hurt expression since his Ability requires him to sacrifice a {{Heart}}.
*Eclipse is the second [[Toon]] to have an [[Ability]] that only works during [[Blackouts]] and [[Floor Events]] in general, the other being {{CI|Brightney|name=true}}.
*Eclipse and [[Ginger]] have reflected and flipped [[Stats]].
**When you take the opposite modification of Eclipse's Stats (+1 Star to Movement Speed -> -1), you get Ginger's Stats, making them reflective.
**When you flip over the Star amount in Eclipses Stats (Movement Speed Stars to Stealth, vice versa), they also become Ginger's.
*When talking to [[Brightney]], {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, and {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, Eclipse makes it clear that she envies bright lights, which parallels her larger light radius and her being a werewolf, always looking to the moon.
*Despite being a werewolf (man-wolf, by its etymology), Eclipse has no human form, only having a normal and feral version.
*Eclipse and [[Ribecca]] are the only [[Halloween Toons]] to not get a mask in the [[Haunted Gala]], likely due to her [[Ability]] only working in [[Blackouts]] and those spawning really rarely in the Haunted Galas, as well as the fact it's a Passive Ability.
*Eclipse's 2 Star [[Stealth]] likely reflects her tendency to howl, while the [[Movement Speed]] and [[Stamina]] gained when she transforms in [[Blackouts]] reflects her increased bulk during such [[Floor Events]].
**Her Stealth Stat is further supported by her {{CI|Twisted Eclipse}}[[Twisted Eclipse|Twisted counterpart]]'s ability to attract other wandering [[Twisteds]] through howling.
*Eclipse is the only [[Toon]] to have two separate sets of Emotes in her {{Skin|QoM}} [[Skin]]:
**Normally, she plays an air guitar while bobbing to the beat of the song, followed by leaning back, before posing with her wrists bent and a leg raised. In her werewolf form, she plays the air guitar more aggressively, followed by headbanging and holding up a hand in a similar style to putting up the sign of the horns, before posing with her arms out in front of her while leaning forward.
*According to the Queens of Mischief music video and [[Changelog|v0.29.7]] thumbnail, Eclipse can play the electric guitar.

